WEBVTT

00:00:03.255 --> 00:00:07.776
The agent board has one card per agent, with presence, a status badge,

00:00:07.776 --> 00:00:12.060
the active interactions, and the queues the agent is signed in to.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.915
Here the one agent is Available, and idle.

00:00:15.402 --> 00:00:20.124
Filter by Agent name, by Signed-in queue, and by Status:

00:00:20.124 --> 00:00:24.313
Available, Busy, On a call, Not ready or Offline.

00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:26.978
Busy groups everyone at work:

00:00:26.978 --> 00:00:29.872
Reserved, On a call and Wrap-up.

00:00:30.327 --> 00:00:32.928
The header counts the agents that match.

00:00:32.928 --> 00:00:36.037
The browser remembers your filters for next time.

